Z||000004||lowCG||11-05-2001||11:03 PM||||I've got two 14"X4"dia.stainless,ceramic wool lined 2-1/2" mufflers,the exhaust "Y"ing out into both.It's rather noisy,and my neighbors do notice,good thing(for them anyways)I don't drive it everyday.<BR>The larger V6 is tough to keep quiet with so little room for mufflers.<BR>One idea was to have the tubing "S" around,back and forth,between the trunk,and the subframe,three times,so that the outlets wind up in the factory locations.<BR>That would give the system some volume,could also add the collector baffles,and it'd allow the exhaust to cool a bit before the mufflers.||||reg||1
Z||000005||BlackDragon||11-06-2001||12:56 AM||||i need the muffler to be under 10 inches in length. the shorter the better.||||reg||1
